                                                "text": "Such a male-dominated environment is also likely to contribute to the lingering presence of an outdated belief that expressing feelings and demonstrating emotion is a sign of weakness, deterring some men from discussing their problems."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3395885f-326b-42fd-a422-7e6b9422e04f",
                                                "sense_id": "c9ee7bf9-31b7-34d1-adb7-57852e2c0793",
                                                "text": "Among the remaining contention points between the two armies is an eastern region called the Depsang Plains. Military analysts said that the Chinese Army was not allowing Indian troops to patrol in that area, even though they have done so for decades. While India’s military is already stretched thin, said Saurav Jha, editor in chief of the Delhi Defense Review, it still needs to keep up a permanent patrol to deter China."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fd44f455-9b3c-3a25-b980-9c2f28a5c49e",
                                        "entry_id": "318aaa14-d815-33a4-8230-aba36032e95a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To distract someone from something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d6309a1-2ef6-4605-97b9-cd57889d5d9b",
                                                "sense_id": "fd44f455-9b3c-3a25-b980-9c2f28a5c49e",
                                                "text": "we have in following enquiry, attempted to throw some light upon subjects, from which uncertainty has hitherto deterred the wise"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bfacc20f-b42d-4a46-8ff1-825cb7dcfdde",
                        "source_entry_id": "62b42239-f1ce-367f-81fe-8dfaeeac6e79",
                        "source_sense_description": "заставлять отказаться от каких-либо действий",
                        "target_lang_word": "discourage",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "discourage",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ef21148a-0e84-32a6-acab-1f6f216e9293",
                                        "entry_id": "5d86a8ae-2c0b-3907-b601-7574d3276c0f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To extinguish the courage of; to dishearten; to depress the spirits of; to deprive of confidence; to deject."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "077d7237-72c0-45ff-ac0f-9acbd712e94f",
                                                "sense_id": "ef21148a-0e84-32a6-acab-1f6f216e9293",
                                                "text": "Don't be discouraged by the amount of work left to do: you'll finish it in good time."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51cb1cdf-784e-42e8-9076-10ce0baec0bb",
                                                "sense_id": "ef21148a-0e84-32a6-acab-1f6f216e9293",
                                                "text": "Fathers, provoke not your children to anger, lest they be discouraged."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5e4af727-bda9-3328-8505-220df004e9f0",
                                        "entry_id": "5d86a8ae-2c0b-3907-b601-7574d3276c0f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To persuade somebody not to do (something)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c647ee38-56a8-4eb6-8b85-bbafaaf3743f",
                                                "sense_id": "5e4af727-bda9-3328-8505-220df004e9f0",
                                                "text": "Discourage litigation. Persuade your neighbors to compromise whenever you can."
